Dear colleagues,

Registration is now open for APLAS & ATVA 2026, which will be held in =
Hong Kong from 1=E2=80=934 December 2026.

Registration link:
https://event-reg.hkust.edu.hk/hkust-mcp/checkout/419/aplas-atva-2026

Important dates:

Early-bird registration deadline: 15 October 2026, 23:59 Hong Kong Time
Regular registration opens: 16 October 2026, 00:00 Hong Kong Time
Registration fees (HKD):

Student: HKD 2,350 early bird / HKD 3,150 regular
Non-student: HKD 4,300 early bird / HKD 5,900 regular
Extra banquet ticket: HKD 750
Registration covers the main APLAS and ATVA conferences, the Student =
Research Competition and associated poster session, the New Ideas and =
Emerging Results (NIER) workshop, the Spotlights of Verification =
workshop, lunches, refreshments, and the conference banquet.

The overall schedule is as follows:

1 December: Workshops, SRC, and posters
2 December: APLAS and ATVA
3 December: APLAS, ATVA, and conference banquet
4 December: ATVA
For further information, please visit:
https://conf.researchr.org/home/aplas-atva-2026

We look forward to welcoming you to Hong Kong!

Best regards,

Wenjia Ye
on behalf of the APLAS & ATVA 2026 Organizing Committee=

